# This static landing page needs NO environment variables to build or deploy.
#
# OPTIONAL: if you later connect a real form service (for example Formspree),
# its public form URL could go here. VITE_ variables are bundled into the
# browser code, so NEVER put passwords, tokens or private API keys in them.
#
# VITE_REGISTRATION_ENDPOINT=https://example.com/your-public-form-endpoint
